<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Dalem Waturenggong</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">16th century</span> · <a href="/centuries/16th-century">16th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Dalem Waturenggong was king of Gelgel in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bali">Bali</a> in the 16th century, under whom the kingdom reached its height. His realm included Bali, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lombok">Lombok</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/blambangan">Blambangan</a> in eastern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/java">Java</a> and parts of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sumbawa">Sumbawa</a>, and his court received the Javanese priest <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dang-hyang-nirartha">Dang Hyang Nirartha</a>, who reshaped Balinese religion.</p></div>
